    "Source refresh and provider windows stage immutable inputs and a prepared record before catalog publication.",
    "Catalog acceptance precedes retained-file replacement. Startup resolves prepared outcomes or completes committed retention before reading input files.",
    "A prepared record whose prior and candidate catalog match cannot prove acceptance. Recovery discards that pending transaction.",
    "Recovery validates every referenced input before any retained-file write. Invalid records and unresolved heads remain unchanged. Migration refuses pending publication.",
