    "Completed immutable input records remain on disk. CSP5 must implement bounded safe collection before release qualification.",
    "CSP11 owns shared fleet recovery. Native interruption, downgrade, release qualification, and the full repository publication gate remain open.",
    "Broad checks precede the final prior-head-first recovery condition and its cancellation tests. The final 20 race events cover those recovery and cancellation cases.",
    "The 78 non-runtime normal suites precede later report and test-helper changes. The corrected runtime suite and focused tests cover those changes.",
    "All 50 primary cases remain UNVERIFIED. CSP3 remains in progress. No push or native CI dispatch occurred."
  ],
